# So why is Git so popular?

**Without Git:**

You create many backup folders.
You can lose work.
Teams overwrite each other's changes.
It's hard to know who changed what.

**With Git:**

Every change is tracked.
You can restore old versions.
Multiple developers can work together.
You know who made each change and when.
You can experiment without fear because you can always go back.